| Grade 5 year-end check (session 52, week 26; respond session 53, week 27) | 17 | 1 | 1 | This is unit 17's end-of-unit assessment (its unseen page and the team problem rehearsal), plus samples from unit 16 on new cases: mixed clues and a check-in, a compromise where both give something up, the refusal steps against a social cost. Forms: one unseen scene page and one watched rehearsal per pair. |

## Cross-subject

SEL is free-standing; each unit names one link to a core course of the same year (bar part 9 item 9) that the teacher may use. None is needed before the SEL unit can be taught: where the core course teaches the lean later, the bridge column says what the SEL unit does itself. Weeks for SEL units are those in the Units table.

