175: 
176: Read in full for this review: the criteria paper, pp 1 to 3 and 20 to 35 (design criteria, design updates, implementation
177: criteria, final designation). Already on file: the EEF primary SEL guidance (six recommendations, SAFE),
178: Durlak and others 2011 and Cipriano and others 2023 (abstracts only), Oregon's transformative SEL tool

