222: 
223: SEL is free-standing; each unit names one link to a core course of the same year (bar part 9 item 9) that the teacher may use. None is needed before the SEL unit can be taught: where the core course teaches the lean later, the bridge column says what the SEL unit does itself. Weeks for SEL units are those in the Units table.
