309: AASL V.D.1 is taught with SM3 (units 6, 8 and 14), V.D.2 with SA8 (units 6, 12 and 14) and III.D.2 with RS4 (units 6, 7 and 17): no SEL unit waits on library. docs/courses/library/STANDARD.md section 4 and data/plans/library-excluded.csv place them in SEL. The grade 5 owner rows (g5-sm-stay-on-task, g5-sa-skills-grow, g5-rel-teamwork) and units 14 and 17 name them; they move into the rows' standard cells once scripts/progression.py accepts AASL ids for SEL (For the lead 3).
