162: g4-sa-tell-truth | ~CASEL.Self-Awareness.4 | Unit 1, Team rules we make. On a team case where a teammate wants to hide a mistake from the teacher, the student uses stop-think-choose to pick the honest action, says how the teammate sees it, and finds a way to be honest that respects them. Grade 4 adds the teammate's view of the honest choice. Checked on the invented case only, never on a student's own conduct.
163: g4-rel-talk-listen | ~CASEL.Relationship Skills.1 | Unit 1, Team rules we make. Before the class agrees a team norm, the student uses the talk turn card to say back a partner's view and then their own, and checks that the partner feels heard. This year the listener reports the other person's view, not only their words.
