127: Consequently, the clean placement check cannot verify this agreed responsibility. Simply adding the codes will also require validator support: SEL currently accepts only casel-5.txt.
128: 
129: **Exact fix:** Record these three codes on the stated owner rows and units, with their teaching and evidence. The lead should add narrowly scoped validator recognition and the agreed band ownership treatment for these transferred codes, without making SEL responsible for the rest of the AASL framework. Replace For the lead 4 with the resulting ownership statement after that work lands.
